  "project_description": "Features \n A module that adds a string of pumpkin lights to the top of your website. The Jack-o'-lanterns randomly glow as if lit by a candle.\n\n Post-Installation \n Just enable the module and the Halloween Lights display on every non-admin page.\n\n Similar projects \n Inspired by the Happy New Year and Merry Christmas! module.\n\n Halloween Lights is also available for Backdrop CMS .\n\n The Academy of Model Aeronautics supported development of this module. Back to top",
